Alembic migrations for Spasht.

The database URL is read from app.config (backend/.env), not alembic.ini.

  make migrate                       # upgrade to head
  cd backend && .venv/bin/alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add x"
  cd backend && .venv/bin/alembic downgrade -1

Append-only tables (receipts, consents, audit_log, teachback_attempts) get their
forbid_update_delete() triggers in the phase-2 migration.
